      <activity id="952ac18b-ef12-5f7d-83cb-6932b9b5338e" activityNameId="7555913a-3aaa-5b74-815b-a9e372cb4538" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, at refinery
This data set describes the beneficiation, concentration and refinement of gold.;
CAS number: 007440-57-5; 
UUID: 2e735f49-3991-37b6-a08c-6b3300cb3619
This data set describes the mining of gold concentrate in South Africa. It includes energy and water consumption, land use, transports, waste disposal as well as emissions to air and water.
Location: Material requirements for gold concentration as well as emissions to air are estimated with Australian data.
Technology: The mining of ore from  underground mines is considered.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 14.34 t gold
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: See Geography, electricity mix is extrapolated
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2e735f49-3991-37b6-a08c-6b3300cb3619.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="bd3c70f6-d406-5543-9b50-64a467a9d88f" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
